os&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;+ regen 15 HP/s" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="235" y="380" width="190" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value="Jarak ≤ 2.6 m &amp;amp;&lt;br&gt;cooldown siap" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=0.08;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="290" width="190" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a3" value="&lt;b&gt;Ground Slam&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;windup 0.8 s → area 3 m,&lt;br&gt;25 damage" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="450" y="380" width="190" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4a" value="Phase 2 (enraged)" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=0.08;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="665" y="290" width="190" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4b" value="Melihat player, jarak&lt;br&gt;4.5–10 m &amp;amp; cooldown siap" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=0.08;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="665" y="370" width="190" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a4" value="&lt;b&gt;Charge&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;windup 0.6 s → dash 0.8 s,&lt;br&gt;20 damage" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="665" y="460" width="190" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value="Player / LKP&lt;br&gt;di dalam arena" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=0.08;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="290" width="190" height="54" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="a5" value="&lt;b&gt;Kejar&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;ke player / Last Known Position" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="880" y="380" width="190" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend_s" value="? SELECTOR" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="570" width="120" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend_q" value="→ SEQUENCE" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontStyle=1;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="150" y="570" width="120" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend_c" value="Condition" style="shape=hexagon;perimeter=hexagonPerimeter2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=0.08;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="280" y="570" width="120" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="legend_a" value="Action" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="410" y="570" width="120" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Selector&lt;/b&gt;: coba child dari kiri ke kanan, berhenti di child pertama yang berhasil / masih berjalan.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sequence&lt;/b&gt;: semua child harus berhasil berurutan.&lt;br&gt;Enrage, Slam, dan Charge bersifat &lt;i&gt;committed&lt;/i&gt;: sekali mulai, diselesaikan dulu sebelum cabang lain mengambil alih.&lt;br&gt;Jalur node aktif tampil di AI Debug Mode (F1), contoh: &lt;i&gt;BT : Root &amp;gt; Ground Slam &amp;gt; Slam [Running]&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#444444;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="555" width="720" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e0" value="" styl